#!/bin/sh /etc/rc.common
# AT broker for the management channel, ubus object u30pro.at (LuCI, rpcd, u30pro-atc).  The dialler (u30pro-celld) keeps /dev/stty_nr0.
START=47
USE_PROCD=1
start_service() {
	grep -q 'u30pro.modem=auto' /proc/cmdline || return 0
	procd_open_instance atd
	procd_set_param command /usr/sbin/u30pro-atd -p /dev/stty_nr2
	procd_set_param respawn 3600 5 0
	procd_set_param stdout 1
	procd_set_param stderr 1
	procd_close_instance
}
